## Quick Reference

| Use Case                          | Applicable License |
|-----------------------------------|--------------------|
| Open-source project / internal tool | AGPLv3             |
| Commercial, SaaS, Closed-Source   | MIT                |
| Enterprise / Support SLA          | office@greev.com   |

**Rule of thumb:**
- Open-source or internal → **AGPL-3.0-or-later**
- Commercial / Closed-Source → **MIT**
- Unsure or need support → office@greev.com

